   prompt| ```codex-helper-artifacts
   prompt| {"version":1,"files":[{"path":"relative/path.ext","name":"display-name.ext"}]}
   prompt| ```
   prompt|
   prompt| Use only relative manifest paths under that directory. Keep your normal answer visible; the helper will upload listed files separately when file-write auth is available.
