== cli
$ cxp teams chat recreate s001
   exit 1
   stderr| Error: recreating a work chat creates a new Teams chat and sends messages; rerun with --yes
$ cxp teams chat recreate s001 --history some --yes
   exit 1
   stderr| Error: invalid --history "some": expected none or full
$ cxp teams chat recreate s999 --yes
   exit 1
   stdout| Waiting for the running Teams helper...
   stderr| Error: Teams session not found for "s999"
$ cxp teams chat recreate s001 --history full --yes
   exit 0
   stdout| Waiting for the running Teams helper...
   stdout| Teams work chat recreated: https://teams.microsoft.com/l/chat/<chat:3>/0?tenantId=e2e00000-0000-4000-8000-00000000te57
   stdout| Title: 💬 e2ehost - Plan the cache
   stdout| Chat ID: <chat:3>
   stdout| Session: s001
   stdout| Previous Chat ID: <chat:2>
   stdout| The running Teams helper now uses the new work chat.
